  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your eyes possess the power of the monstrous judrai.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Hallucinatory Gaze, nocturne gaze species trait, character level 9th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Instead of causing a creature to treat all other creatures as though they had concealment, you can use your nocturne gaze as a standard action to cause a creature to see a hallucinatory terrain. At 15th level, you may instead cause a creature to see a mirage arcana. If you possess the Terror Eyes feat (see page 336), a creature affected by your nocturne gaze is also shaken for its duration.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Using nocturne gaze is a move action.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat may not be used along with the Instant Gaze feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/judow#toc33\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
